## Changes Made\
\
### 1. Core Node Abstraction\
- Created [BaseNode.js](file:///Users/ayushdwivedy/Desktop/VectorShift/frontend/src/nodes/BaseNode.js) which provides:\
  - **Declarative Handle Positioning**: Automatically computes even vertical spacing (`top` percentage) for incoming and outgoing connection ports when multiple handles are present.\
  - **Consistent Layout & Theming Hook**: A unified card layout containing header bars, titles, category labels, and body forms\'97making future visual styling updates effortless.\
  - **Store Synchronization Hook**: Exported a custom `useNodeField` helper hook that binds local form controls directly to Zustand's `updateNodeField` store method.\
\
### 2. Refactored Existing Nodes\
Refactored the four provided components to consume `BaseNode`, removing repetitive boilerplate CSS containers and manual handle calculations:\
- [InputNode](file:///Users/ayushdwivedy/Desktop/VectorShift/frontend/src/nodes/inputNode.js) (`customInput`)\
- [OutputNode](file:///Users/ayushdwivedy/Desktop/VectorShift/frontend/src/nodes/outputNode.js) (`customOutput`)\
- [LLMNode](file:///Users/ayushdwivedy/Desktop/VectorShift/frontend/src/nodes/llmNode.js) (`llm`)\
- [TextNode](file:///Users/ayushdwivedy/Desktop/VectorShift/frontend/src/nodes/textNode.js) (`text`)\
\
### 3. Developed 5 New AI Workflow Nodes\
Created five versatile nodes to showcase the efficiency and range of `BaseNode`:\
1. **[NoteNode](file:///Users/ayushdwivedy/Desktop/VectorShift/frontend/src/nodes/noteNode.js)** (`note`): A sticky note comment/annotation node with 0 handles.\
2. **[ConditionNode](file:///Users/ayushdwivedy/Desktop/VectorShift/frontend/src/nodes/conditionNode.js)** (`condition`): A branching router with 1 input and 2 distinct outputs (`true` and `false`).\
3. **[DatabaseNode](file:///Users/ayushdwivedy/Desktop/VectorShift/frontend/src/nodes/databaseNode.js)** (`database`): A vector database similarity lookup node supporting Pinecone, Qdrant, ChromaDB, and Weaviate.\
4. **[APINode](file:///Users/ayushdwivedy/Desktop/VectorShift/frontend/src/nodes/apiNode.js)** (`api`): An HTTP REST API request builder with 3 inputs (`params`, `headers`, `body`).\
5. **[FilterNode](file:///Users/ayushdwivedy/Desktop/VectorShift/frontend/src/nodes/filterNode.js)** (`filter`): A streaming data filter with regex, keyword, and length comparison options.\
\
### 4. UI & Toolbar Registration\
- Registered the 5 new components within ReactFlow's `nodeTypes` directory in [ui.js](file:///Users/ayushdwivedy/Desktop/VectorShift/frontend/src/ui.js).\
- Added corresponding drag-and-drop preview pills to the header toolbar in [toolbar.js](file:///Users/ayushdwivedy/Desktop/VectorShift/frontend/src/toolbar.js), bringing the total draggable node palette to 9 items.\
